## Professional .gitignore for .NET / Visual Studio with Skia dependencies

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userユーザー
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa]rm/
[Aa]rm64/
bbin/
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio cache and artifacts
.vs/
LocalHistory/
TestResults/
*.vshost.exe*
*.manifest
*.bak

# NuGet Packages architecture caches
*.nupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/repositories.config
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

# Specialized Skia / OS Temporary graphics dumps
*.log
*.tmp
